     The lliibbssaa library provides a set of supporting functions for standalone
     applications, mimicking where possible the standard BSD programming envi‐
     ronment.  The following sections group these functions by kind.  Unless
     specifically described here, see the corresponding section 3 manpages for
     the given functions.

